Additional curated QA setting runs
Date: 2026-05-01
Input: data/golden_qa.json (25 curated QA pairs)
Reference: outputs/curated_golden_eval_reference.json

Settings selected from archive for methodological diversity:
- c01_similarity_180_30_k3: small word-TF-IDF similarity baseline, top-3, no rerank
- c04_similarity_320_70_k5_lexical: larger word-TF-IDF chunks with lexical rerank, high-recall setting
- c07_mmr_260_55_fetch20_lexical: MMR retrieval with lexical rerank, most diverse retrieval strategy
- c08_similarity_char_260_55_k5: char ngram TF-IDF with lexical rerank

Commands pattern:
- python3 main.py --config outputs/curated_setting_runs/configs/<run>.json --input data/golden_qa.json --output outputs/curated_setting_runs/answers/<run>_answers.json
- python3 Metrics/evaluate_retrieval.py --output outputs/curated_setting_runs/answers/<run>_answers.json --validation outputs/curated_golden_eval_reference.json --k 5 > outputs/curated_setting_runs/metrics/<run>_retrieval_metrics.json
- python3 Metrics/run_judge.py --output outputs/curated_setting_runs/answers/<run>_answers.json --validation outputs/curated_golden_eval_reference.json --base-url https://tritonai-api.ucsd.edu/v1 --model claude-sonnet-4-6 > outputs/curated_setting_runs/metrics/<run>_generation_metrics.json

